## Change

- Java `MessageExt.setBornHostV6Flag()` and
  `setStoreHostAddressV6Flag()` now dispatch through `MessageExtSubtype`.
  The fallback path still sets each corresponding sysFlag bit.
- The invoked direct-consume Java/Rust fixture overrides both setters and
  compares the subtype write count and other metadata views.

